{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_title", "source_sha256": "cea00d282488294e16582436474b38e92c520ce5830093c07f145f0b61457d6f", "ja": "笑顔のなかで", "zh": "在笑容之中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e862bd8587aef031c162561b5d0c6c977aadc86e13d5e7549b98b36e2b918d1a", "ja": "センターを任された美奈子は、自分のこと\nそっちのけでメンバーのフォローを続け、\n場を盛り上げる。彼女のリラックス方法は\nいつも通りの、みんなへのお世話だった。\n育まれた温かい絆で、ステージは成功する。", "zh": "被选为Center的美奈子，\n总是将自己的事放在一旁，\n以协助团员为优先，让现场气氛热络起来。\n她放松的方法，就是一如既往地照顾大家。\n在彼此累积的深厚羁绊下，表演圆满落幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b4145e3e0206de36bab032e5f1dac1ee90093638a52c5993d04f25c4645d2a76", "ja": "美奈子、今ちょっといいか？", "zh": "美奈子，你现在有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "11488b13eb452c318b416635ec382f98b2a4d145fbfd4bb40a5441f09585a149", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n大丈夫ですよ、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，你辛苦了！\n我有空喔，有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8bed5e1817e7b3cfea8913fa6aa7a1eeb855f7655b46c947985d9f2af179e300", "ja": "次のライブなんだけど、実は……\n美奈子にセンターをやってもらおうと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "关于下次的演唱会，其实……\n我想让美奈子来担任Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "4dc2c9903de69975cbec3e4f2b33a8de44cbeb0ebc2ed51bb3e278836d05d9ab", "ja": "え……私がですか！？", "zh": "咦……我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "9768ae15a8090f870e09c4f2fc85c883bf682a4e8227659e66867db4d03109c8", "ja": "わぁ……すごいね、美奈子さん！\nセンターだって！", "zh": "哇……好厉害喔，美奈子姊姊！\n你要当Center耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "edf5e2a4d35a5c5ec5cc7060d11b84f59eebc46ae870d61d4004a59b1a457fae", "ja": "さすが、美奈子さんだねぇ。\nあたしらも頑張らねばだよぉ。", "zh": "真不愧是美奈子呢～\n我们也得好好加油才行哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "a797d0584e7b66bf930a48ea9e4254d4fe5d3b9096654fc4d43b6164bfc64c12", "ja": "うん！　わたしも頑張る！\n美奈子さん、わたし、負けないからね！", "zh": "嗯！我也会加油的！\n美奈子姊姊，我也不会输给你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "50c99e476f135f12baac25ec9a67b154c42b08de02c94dc2fdb2ef92841ce98c", "ja": "うん♪\nじゃあ私も、ふたりに負けないように頑張るね！", "zh": "嗯♪\n那我会好好加油，努力不要输给你们两个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1008_p", "source_sha256": "45da5f4bba7f679a80b8fe2b44b7743a4f3060e44751126d0e83cd2a3c4f280b", "ja": "はは、やる気十分だな。それじゃ……。", "zh": "哈哈，很有干劲呢。那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "aabadf571473c9940146ae96984a039155783bbffc2d4b499f970a02a2feda83", "ja": "はい、センター頑張りますっ！\n初めてのことで、不安もありますけど……。", "zh": "是，我会努力当好Center！\n虽然这是我第一次挑战，多少有点不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "7def211d13c65f39aafc503102b7dba05307a8340ae82b4e855fbc9e5f2833ce", "ja": "よろしくお願いしますね、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "但还是请你多多指教了，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_008_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d387df298a668d22973ed6646fbe202268e628c2f688fe772eca352bbd3dd3e8", "ja": "ああ、こちらこそ。\n頼んだぞ！", "zh": "嗯，也请你多多指教。\n拜托你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
